abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the paper "Machine Learning for Bus-Level Fault
  Location in Active Distribution Networks", including OpenDSS simulation,
  physics-informed PMU features, algorithmic sensor placement, and a
  reproducible 5-fold benchmark on the IEEE 123-bus feeder.
keywords:
  - active distribution networks
  - deep learning
  - distributed generation
  - fault location
  - IEEE 123-bus feeder
  - phasor measurement units
  - sensor placement
  - total vector error
